WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Type a request in Caelis Bot. It replies and starts two background Workers.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Hover a task bubble and open its Codex terminal. Results return to the same Bot conversation.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Bot notices a long work session in the conversation, creates a callback for a natural break, then reaches out. Your reply shapes the next reminder.
